OL,3,GNEWSAFrom violent fantasies to
OL,4,Aattempted murder ` how a school knife
OL,5,Aattack unfolded
OL,6,
OL,7,FWarning: The following report contains
OL,8,Fdetails that some may find distressing
OL,10,FA teenage girl stabbed, armed police
OL,11,Fdeployed, schools locked down and
OL,12,Fworried parents gathering outside,
OL,13,Fdesperate for information.
OL,15,FThose were the scenes in March when a
OL,16,Fmasked 15-year-old boy armed with a
OL,17,Fknife attacked another pupil at Thorpe
OL,18,FSt Andrew School, near Norwich.
OL,20,FThe boy, now 16, has been found guilty
OL,21,Fof attempted murder following a trial
OL,22,Fat King's Lynn Crown Court.
